e Tested Both for 2 Weeks\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/40\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Nebulaa Team\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"March 8, 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"·\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"5 min read\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose-nebulaa\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"title: \\\"GTM Experiment #3: WhatsApp vs Email Outreach — We Tested Both for 2 Weeks\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"category: \\\"GTM Experiments\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"date: \\\"March 8, 2026\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"readTime: \\\"5 min read\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"author: \\\"Nebulaa Team\\\"\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"GTM Experiment #3: WhatsApp vs Email Outreach — We Tested Both for 2 Weeks\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"Same leads. Same message. Two channels. Very different results.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"This experiment came from a simple observation: Karan, who runs a logistics SaaS for e-commerce companies in Chennai, was getting roughly 2–3% reply rates on his outbound email sequences. He'd heard WhatsApp had higher open rates. He wanted to know if that actually translated to replies and demos, or if it was just a vanity metric.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"He split 200 qualified leads down the middle and ran both channels for two weeks with Pulsar. Here's the full breakdown.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"The Setup\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**200 leads** — all e-commerce companies with 100–500 shipments per month, sourced from a combination of LinkedIn and a lead database. Each lead had a phone number and an email address.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Group A (100 leads)**: Outreach via email only. Three-email sequence over 10 days:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Email 1 (Day 1): Introduction + one specific insight about their logistics cost\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Email 2 (Day 4): Case study of a similar company\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Email 3 (Day 9): Breakup email (\\\"Closing your file unless…\\\")\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Group B (100 leads)**: Outreach via WhatsApp only. Three-message sequence over 10 days, identical content adapted for WhatsApp format — shorter, more conversational, no formal salutation.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Pulsar handled both sequences** — personalising each message with company name, shipment volume tier, and a specific pain point relevant to their geography.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"27\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"The Results\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[\"$\",\"div\",\"37\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"WhatsApp got **4x the reply rate** and **7x the demo bookings** from the same leads, with the same message.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"39\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Why WhatsApp Outperforms Email for Indian B2B\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"41\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**1. Read receipts change behaviour.** With email, you never know if they saw it. WhatsApp's double blue ticks mean the lead knows you know they read it. This subtly increases response pressure — in a good way.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**2. Inbox competition is lower.** The average Indian professional gets 80–120 emails per day. Their WhatsApp business messages? Maybe 5–10. Being a small fish in a small pond beats being invisible in the ocean.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"46\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**3. The format is naturally casual.** Email invites formal language. Formal language feels like a pitch. WhatsApp invites conversation. Conversation leads to replies.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"48\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**4. Indian communication culture favours WhatsApp.** Whether you're talking to a distributor in Surat, a logistics head in Pune, or a startup ops lead in Hyderabad — WhatsApp is the channel where real decisions get discussed. Email is for paper trails.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"50\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"What Didn't Work on WhatsApp\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"52\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**4 people blocked Pulsar's number.** All four were from large enterprise companies (500+ employees) where WhatsApp outreach is seen as unprofessional. For mid-market and SMB, WhatsApp wins. For enterprise, email is still safer.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"54\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"**Message length mattered a lot.** Early drafts that were too long (4+ paragraphs) got lower reply rates than short, punchy messages. The best-performing WhatsApp message was 63 words.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"56\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"The Follow-Up Experiment\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"58\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"After the 10-day sequence, Karan ran a third group: email first, then WhatsApp follow-up for non-openers. The combined channel approach got an 18% reply rate — the best of all three approaches.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"59\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"60\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"The lesson: use email to establish legitimacy, use WhatsApp to get the actual response.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"61\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"62\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Conclusion\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"63\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"64\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed my-3\",\"children\":\"If you're doing B2B outreach in India and you're not using WhatsApp, you're leaving a significant amount of pipeline on the table. The data is clear. Pulsar can run sequences across both channels simultaneously — personalised, timed, and tracked.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"65\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"66\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"67\",{\"className\":\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Key Takeaways\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"68\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"69\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"WhatsApp reply rates are 4–5x higher than email for Indian B2B SMB outreach\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"70\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Shorter messages outperform longer ones on WhatsApp (aim for under 75 words)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"71\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Enterprise leads prefer email — adjust your channel by segment size\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"72\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2 my-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-brand-gold mt-1 flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-base text-brand-text dark:text-white/80 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The highest reply rates come from a combined email + WhatsApp sequence\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"73\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"74\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"75\",{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 italic my-2\",\"children\":\"Want Pulsar to run your next outreach experiment across both channels? [Start your free 7-day trial →](/)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"76\",{\"className\":\"my-3\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 bg-brand-gold-pale dark:bg-brand-gold/8 border border-brand-gold/20 dark:border-brand-gold/15 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-2\",\"children\":\"Ready to automate your GTM?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/50 mb-4\",\"children\":\"100 free credits. No card required. Setup in 24 hours.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/pricing\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-gold text-brand-black font-body font-semibold rounded-full px-6 py-3 hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all hover:scale-[1.03]\",\"children\":\"Start your free trial →\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-8 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"font-body text-sm text-brand-muted dark:text-white/30 hover:text-brand-gold dark:hover:text-brand-gold transition-colors\",\"children\":\"← Back to all posts\"}]}]]}]}]\n9:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"title\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing & Outreach Agents for Founders\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated. Gravity posts, Pulsar calls. Built for Indian founders and SMBs. Start free — 100 credits, no card.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"6\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Nebulaa.ai — Your GTM Team Just Showed Up\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Gravity posts. Pulsar calls. You close.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:site_name\",\"content\":\"Nebulaa.ai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:locale\",\"content\":\"en_IN\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"website\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:site\",\"content\":\"@nebulaaai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing & Outreach for Founders\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"17\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"16x16\"}]]\n1:null\n"}